        "original_id": "ec313c3c-dbfd-5c41-b130-7e5e41b24a55",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Backpacker murders\n- People: Ivan Milat\n- Places: New South Wales, Australia; Belanglo State Forest; Berrima\n- Organizations: New South Wales Government\n- Topics: serial killings\n\nFacts:\n- The Backpacker murders were a spate of serial killings committed by Ivan Milat in New South Wales, Australia, between 1989 and 1993.\n- The bodies of seven missing young people aged 19 to 22 were found partially buried in Belanglo State Forest, 15 km south west of Berrima in New South Wales.\n- Belanglo State Forest is owned by the New South Wales Government and contains some of the earliest pine plantings in New South Wales.",
